      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-38624\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/2050#5815\">Identifying the Polynomial Given its Graph</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"38624\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-38624\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following polynomials could be the function shown in the diagram above?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Fri, Oct 16th @ 6:19 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:17</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
